.Dd 2026-05-30
.Dt NOMAD-UNINSTALL-FIELD-DESK 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nomad-uninstall-field-desk
.Nd remove NOMAD Field Desk, leaving the shared Ollama untouched
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm nomad uninstall-field-desk
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Removes the SysAdminDoc NOMAD Field Desk app installed by
.Xr nomad-install-field-desk 1 .
It stops a running
.Pa NOMADFieldDesk-macOS
process and deletes the binary from
.Pa ~/Applications/ .
.Pp
Field Desk stores its own data (SQLite database, caches) under the user's home
directory in locations that vary by version. This command
.Em surfaces
any candidate data directories it finds and prints their sizes, but never
removes them automatically \(em you decide what to delete. It does not touch
.Pa ~/.config/project-nomad
(this distribution's own install) or any other vault.
.Pp
The native Metal Ollama daemon on port 11434 is left running; it continues to
serve the Crosstalk admin and any other consumer.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ic nomad uninstall-field-desk
Stop Field Desk, remove its binary, and report any leftover data directories
for manual review.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nomad 1 ,
.Xr nomad-install-field-desk 1
